# Build context for the MediPortal image
# (infrastructure/mediportal/Dockerfile, context: MediPortal/).
#
# Allow-list: only what `npm ci` and `npm run build` need.
# node_modules/ and dist/ are rebuilt inside the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.ts
!tsconfig*.json
!src/
!public/

# Never send local env files or secrets. In particular, a developer's
# .env.local must not change the API URL baked into the image; use
# --build-arg VITE_API_BASE_URL=... instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/*.secret
**/*.secrets
**/*.key
**/*.pem
